@startuml
title ASCS Role and Responsibility Boundaries
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #334155

rectangle "Student\nSubmit / track / print approved record" as Student #E0F2FE
rectangle "Clearance Signatories\nLibrarian\nOSA Coordinator\nGuidance Counselor\nArea Chair\nAdviser" as Signatories #E0F2FE
rectangle "Accountant\nFinancial gate" as Accountant #FEF3C7
rectangle "Dean\nAdviser-approved oversight" as Dean #F3E8FF
rectangle "System Administrator\nAccounts / assignments / reports / logs" as Admin #F1F5F9
rectangle "ASCS\nRole-scoped actions" as ASCS #DBEAFE

Student --> ASCS
Signatories --> ASCS
Accountant --> ASCS
Dean --> ASCS
Admin --> ASCS

note right of Accountant
Not a duplicate approval row.
Updates financialStatus.
end note

note right of Dean
Academic oversight only;
not a required signatory.
end note

note bottom of Signatories
Adviser approval sets adviserApproved
and unlocks Dean visibility.
end note
@enduml
